model pj
  tally 2
  on 2026-03-01
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2027-12-31
  note "T; tally 2.2 (S-2): known is a day, so its known window is stated as the range's last day; the vector that read it as seen and unseen went with the form, and every other answer is as before"

source card "invented"
unit PLN: currency minor 0.01

input rate: money PLN

ask q: rate law 2026-06-01 as known 2026-02-25
ask qw: rate law 2026-06-01 as known 2026-02-25 windows each
ask q27: rate law 2027-06-01 as known 2026-02-25

version v
  cite card
  governs always
  known 2026-01-01
  rate = 10.00 PLN "c"

version v2
  cite card
  governs 2027-01-01..
  known 2026-02-28
  replace rate = 12.00 PLN "c"
